                <pb facs="0913" n="811" sameAs="frus:frus1919v01/pg811"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">818.00/589: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        Nicaragua</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Jefferson</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-04-29T19:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">April 29, 1919,
                                7 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Your April 23, 11 a.m.</p>
                <p>Report to Department any new developments in situation and intimate to President
                    Chamorro that the Department hopes that he will be governed in his actions by
                    the principles of international comity.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Polk</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
